From 8ad07a053c904c69869172f343ebe8fd4877dcf5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien MOYAUX <49562406+adrienm7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:14:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(config): start neutral and persist only explicit
 overrides

Declare neutral defaults and recommended values separately in the shared
manifest. Project those values through each driver owner so missing input
settings remain inactive while pure parameters retain their established
values. Preserve explicit choices and unknown configuration fields.

Describe scope membership and runtime-owned dynamic defaults centrally.
Keep metrics and AI consent outside recommendation restoration. Functional
fixtures opt into their intended presets through the real owner APIs,
while separate startup coverage exercises an empty configuration.
